    <div class="said"><div class="note">yes, go. Sam</div></div>
    <p class="lede">Your team and your agents review every plan, mock-up and decision in one place.</p>
    <button type="button" class="act" data-signup aria-haspopup="dialog">Join the waitlist</button>
