  <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="beams" width="1440" height="1000" viewBox="0 0 1440 1000"><polygon class="v" points="619.2 253.4 684 266 684 293 619.2 345.4 613.2 345.4 613.2 253.4"/><polygon class="a" points="586.8 363.8 1032 413 1032 439 586.8 455.8 580.8 455.8 580.8 363.8"/><polygon class="g" points="835.1 474.2 1032 608 1032 666 835.1 566.2 829.1 566.2 829.1 474.2"/></svg>

    <article class="sheet plan main" style="--x:684px;--y:72px;--w:324px;--mw:342px">
      <h2>Edit a note with no signal</h2>
      <p class="pr">Larch is our notes app for field crews, who often have no signal. Each edit saves on the phone first, then sends in order.</p>
      <p class="pr ph">Today an edit made with no signal is gone when the app reconnects. Crews tell us they write a reading down twice, or wait until they are back at the van.</p>
      <div class="fig"><svg class="dw" viewBox="0 0 324 102"><path class="l" d="M47.5 20V102"/><path class="l" d="M162.5 20V102"/><path class="l" d="M276.5 20V102"/><rect class="hit v" x="0" y="69" width="324" height="27"/><path class="k" d="M47.5 69V96"/><path class="k" d="M162.5 69V96"/><path class="k" d="M276.5 69V96"/><text class="b m" x="47.5" y="12">Phone</text><path class="h" d="M22.5 19.500H72.5"/><text class="b m" x="162.5" y="12">Queue</text><path class="h" d="M137.5 19.500H187.5"/><text class="b m" x="276.5" y="12">Server</text><path class="h" d="M251.5 19.500H301.5"/><rect class="box" x="158" y="40.5" width="9" height="22"/><path class="l" d="M158 48h9M158 55h9"/><path class="h" d="M47.5 40.5H151"/><path class="f" d="M158 40.5l-9 -3.500v7z"/><text class="m" x="102.75" y="33.5">save edit</text><path class="h" d="M167 62.5H269.5"/><path class="f" d="M276.5 62.5l-9 -3.500v7z"/><text class="m" x="221.75" y="55.5">send in order</text><path class="kh" d="M276.5 87.5H54.5"/><path class="kf" d="M47.5 87.5l9 -3.500v7z"/><circle class="kf" cx="276.5" cy="87.5" r="2.600"/><text class="m kt b" x="219.5" y="80.5">keep both</text></svg></div>
      <p class="q">Clashing edits are both kept. <b>Claude Code</b> changed this step on the team’s call.</p>
      <p class="af ph">Before, the newest edit won and the other vanished without a word. Now both lines stay in the note until someone picks one.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="sheet call main" style="--x:1032px;--y:255px;--w:312px;--mw:342px">
      <h2>Which edit wins?</h2>
      <svg class="dw" viewBox="0 0 312 170"><rect class="bx" x="22.5" y=".500" width="126" height="92" rx="3"/><path class="l" d="M22.5 15.500H148.5"/><rect class="f" x="31.5" y="5" width="6" height="7" rx="1"/><rect class="bar" x="43.5" y="6.500" width="34" height="4" rx="2"/><text class="b" x="32.5" y="34.500">Site visit</text><text class="w" x="32.5" y="55">Meter reads 4407</text><text class="w" x="32.5" y="74">Meter reads 4410</text><rect class="bx" x="163.5" y=".500" width="126" height="92" rx="3"/><path class="l" d="M163.5 15.500H289.5"/><rect class="f" x="172.5" y="5" width="6" height="7" rx="1"/><rect class="bar" x="184.5" y="6.500" width="34" height="4" rx="2"/><text class="b" x="173.5" y="34.500">Site visit</text><text class="w" x="173.5" y="55">Meter reads 4410</text><rect class="hit a" x="0" y="102" width="149" height="26"/><text class="kt b" x="22" y="119.600">Keep both</text><text class="b" x="163" y="119.600">Newest wins</text><text class="s n" x="22" y="146">Both readings stay.</text><text class="s n" x="22" y="164">A day more to build.</text><text class="s n" x="163" y="146">One reading is lost.</text><text class="s n" x="163" y="164">Nothing to build.</text></svg>
      <p class="hand">never lose an edit. Alex</p>
    </article>
    <article class="sheet mock main" style="--x:1032px;--y:558px;--w:312px;--mw:342px">
      <div class="app"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3.500 1H9.500L14 5.500V13.500A1.500 1.500 0 0112.500 15H3.500A1.500 1.500 0 012 13.500V2.500A1.500 1.500 0 013.500 1Z"/></svg>Larch<div class="field"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="4.2"/><path d="M9.3 9.3L12.5 12.5"/></svg>Search notes</div></div>
      <div class="res">
        <div class="top1 hit"><svg width="35" height="42" viewBox="0 0 30 36" fill="none"><rect x=".5" y=".5" width="29" height="35" rx="2"/><path d="M6 8h13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 14.500h18M6 20.500h14M6 26.500h14"/></g></svg><span><b>Site visit</b><em>Saved on this phone</em></span><a>Open</a></div>
        <div><svg width="35" height="42" viewBox="0 0 30 36" fill="none"><rect x=".5" y=".5" width="29" height="35" rx="2"/><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".6"><path d="M6 9h10M6 14h18M6 19h18M6 24h13"/></g></svg><span><b>Boiler service</b><em>Sent yesterday</em></span></div>
        <div><svg width="35" height="42" viewBox="0 0 30 36" fill="none"><rect x=".5" y=".5" width="29" height="35" rx="2"/><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".6"><path d="M6 9h6M15 9h9M6 14h6M15 14h6M6 19h6M15 19h9M6 24h6M15 24h7"/></g></svg><span><b>Roof survey</b><em>Sent last week</em></span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="q"><b>Codex</b> built this from the plan.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>

